      "message": "Is there any reason why we would expect to see multiple of these flags set? If so, is this hierarchy of prioritizing checking for general --\u003e validation --\u003e performance what we want? If multiple types are included for whatever reason, perhaps it would be valuable to include all of them. Like `type` could look something like `general, validation` if both are true.",
